			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration to PascalCase indentation\n\nReformat the ESBuild configuration files in `Configuration/ESBuild/` and `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/` to use consistent 1-tab indentation, aligning with the project's strict PascalCase styling conventions and removing inconsistent spacing in function definitions and object properties.\n\nThis applies the standard code style to the build tooling for the Worker component, ensuring the `Target.js` and `Worker.js` configurations match the rest of the codebase without altering build logic or output behavior.",
