			"Message": "docs(Worker): Add project structure map and getting started guide\n\nExpand the README.md for the Worker element with a detailed project structure visualization and explicit getting started instructions. The new section maps the directory hierarchy including the Service worker entry point, caching policy modules, registration logic, CSS loader, and telemetry bridge. It also clarifies that the Worker is a core component of the main Land project and directs users to the parent repository for build instructions.\n\nThis documentation update improves developer onboarding and provides a clear architectural overview of the editor's web worker layer without modifying any code.",
